<template><view class="page"><AppHeader/><view class="content"><view class="module-intro"><view><view class="display">这一次，<br/>想先了解哪一部分？</view><view class="lead">每一次咨询，都是建立个人形象档案的一部分。</view></view><view class="intro-note">A MORE YOU<br/>A RICHER LIFE<br/><br/>看见你<br/>也理解适合你的方式。</view></view><view class="tryon-entry" @click="select('tryon')"><image class="image-monochrome" src="/static/design/profile-domain-outfit.webp" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="shade"></view><view><text class="eyebrow">NEW · VIRTUAL TRY-ON</text><view class="section-title">上传衣服，看看穿在你身上的样子</view><view class="lead">一张清晰全身照＋一张服装图，单件或套装均可</view></view><view class="editorial-btn">开始试衣　→</view></view><view class="module-layout"><view v-for="(m,key,i) in advisorModules" :key="key" class="module" :class="`m-${key}`" @click="select(key)"><image class="image-monochrome" :src="images[key]" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="shade"></view><view class="module-copy"><text class="num">0{{i+1}}</text><text class="name">{{m.name}}</text><text class="desc">{{m.desc}}</text><text class="en">{{m.en}}</text><view class="start">开始咨询　→</view></view></view><view class="archive" @click="profile"><view class="archive-title">你的形象档案</view><view class="archive-line"></view><view class="archive-progress"><text>0</text><text>/ 4</text></view><view class="archive-desc">完成的咨询会在这里形成<br/>连续的个人形象记录。</view><view class="archive-line"></view><view class="archive-slogan">更清晰的你<br/>／<br/>更自在的生活</view><view class="archive-mark"></view><view class="archive-action">了解形象档案　→</view></view></view></view></view></template>
